pe\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[48.98878479003906,749.7115478515625,544.108642578125,759.79150390625],\"text\":\"能性もあります。しかし、仮に手代わりを待つとすると打か打になりますが、「－の７枚が親以外から出\"},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b37\",\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[48.98878479003906,768.4301147460938,539.99462890625,778.5100708007812],\"text\":\"るかツモる」確率の方が愚形待ちの和了率よりも高くなります。故に、ラス回避条件がはっきり良くなるといえるの\"},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b38\",\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[48.98878479003906,786.1911010742188,544.0818481445312,796.2710571289062],\"text\":\"は、打なら･ツモ、打に至ってはツモだけです。２種以下の手変わりを待てる巡目は存在しません。\"},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b39\",\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[0.0302276611328125,0.29436397552490234,594.8794555664062,10.783451080322266],\"text\":\"現代麻雀技術論- 何切る問題検討１．「ネマー日記」ブログ問題http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter06/exercise001.html\"},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b40\",\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[0,831.1987915039062,595.2405395507812,841.667724609375],\"text\":\"第 6 頁，共13 頁2014-03-02 00:07\"},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b41\",\"bbox\":[306.4800109863281,37.44002151489258,319.44000244140625,54.96002197265625],\"type\":\"image\",\"imageSha256\":\"72cbec83db0d95b2c108bf7a05a7e6d894309f00169d013d0f531b321eacb42f\",\"asset\":\"assets/72cbec83db0d95b2c108bf7a05a7e6d894309f00169d013d0f531b321eacb42f.png\",\"width\":54,\"height\":73,\"transform\":[12.960000038146973,0,0,17.520000457763672,306.4800109863281,37.44002151489258]},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b42\",\"bbox\":[324.239990234375,37.44002151489258,337.44000244140625,54.96002197265625],\"type\":\"image\",\"imageSha256\":\"cc38d8492ce1d13e511fc927877c2757dec56ed051f9dc57c92982a4e0c82c5c\",\"asset\":\"assets/cc38d8492ce1d13e511fc927877c2757dec56ed051f9dc57c92982a4e0c82c5c.png\",\"width\":55,\"height\":73,\"transform\":[13.199999809265137,0,0,17.520000457763672,324.239990234375,37.44002151489258]},{\"id\":\"nemata-jp-p255-b43\",\"bbox\":[342.239990234375,37.44002151489258,355.44000244140625,54.96002197265625],\"type\":\"image\",\"imageSha256\":\"8da455ae2dd9b0fe3ad2ed68b41c06f894343f